	(text "Review fixes (Sep 2026): VDDA bulk, VBAT tie + decoupling, NRST cap + NRST pin (J4),\nVBUS_C flag (J3.25 now on fused VBUS).\nRev B: QSPI flash removed (internal 1MB flash); PA2/PA3 = USART2 TX/RX link to USB-HS front-end\n(2-3 Mbaud UART, short wires + GND). USB D+/D- routed as 90R pair, series 0R removed. MCU moved next to USB-C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
