(text "Rev B connectors\nJ5 UART to 8 kHz USB front end: USART2 PA2=TX, PA3=RX (2-3 Mbaud), pin1 GND, pin2 3V3\nJ6 mux breakout: pin3 PA6 = mux SIG (ADC1_IN11), pins 5-8 PA7/PB0/PB1/PB2 = S0..S3, GND on pins 2 and 4\nJ7 ARM 10-pin SWD (SWO = PB3)   SW3 user button on PC13 (enable internal pull-up)   D2 power LED" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 287.02 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d73efe3-9d03-41ad-9f21-ae1503de6512"))
