(text "Rev C: on-board 16:1 analog mux U5 (CD74HC4067). Inputs on J8 (2x10 0.1in header / 20-way IDC ribbon):\nJ8 pin1 3V3, pins 2/11/20 GND, pins 3-10 = TMR_OUT1-8, pins 12-19 = TMR_OUT9-16. Each input: 100R + 4.7nF RC (Rev K; fc 340 kHz, settles to 14 bit ~2.5 us after a mux switch).\nU5 COM -> PC4 (ADC1_IN13 / ADC4_IN22). S0-S3 = PA7/PB0/PB1/PB2, shared with J6 (external mux, SIG = PA6).\nPower the sensors from J8 3V3 so they share the ADC reference (ratiometric)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 287.02 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "227d13fe-9366-4330-b4ae-8ac8857c0443"))
