(text "Rev D: J9 (GND) and J10 (NRST) = tail stabilizer pins, in line with the J3/J2\ncolumns, 11 pitches above pin 1, so the tail rests on the breadboard.\nJ10 replaces the old top-side NRST test pin J4 (NRST is also on J7 pin 10)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 104.14 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9a1c7acc-dd87-4608-b5b4-b58ef8666373"))
